type: software
title: "RSA-MEEG: MATLAB and Python Toolbox for M/EEG Representational Similarity Analysis"
authors:
  - name: "Jingmin An"
  - name: "Cai Wingfield"
  - name: "Chengxuan Li"
  - name: "Andrew Thwaites"
  - name: "Li Su"
version: "0.2.0-v2"
date-released: "2026-11-10"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LiSuLab/RSA-MEG/tree/rsa-meeg"
license: LGPL-3.0-only
abstract: "Open-source MATLAB (+rsa_meeg and +rsa/+sim, +rdm, +mapping, +stats) and Python (rsa_meeg) toolbox for millisecond sensor- and source-space M/EEG representational similarity analysis, 30-scale cortical geodesic Perlin spatial frequency simulation, Ledoit-Wolf shrinkage-whitened crossnobis searchlights, three-tier zero-tie continuous speech RDM parameterization, analytical partial rank regression, and sign-flip cluster permutation inference."
